&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At &lt;a href=&quot;http://prenuvo.com/&quot;&gt;Prenuvo&lt;/a&gt;, we are on a mission to flip the paradigm from reactive “sick-care” to proactive health care. Our award-winning whole body scan is fast (under 1 hour), safe (MRI has no ionizing radiation), and non-invasive (no contrast). Our unique integrated stack of optimized hardware, software, and increasingly AI, coupled with the patient-centric experience across our domestic and global clinics, have allowed us to lead the change against “we caught it too late again&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prenuvo is building a longitudinal care model, where patients have an ongoing clinical relationship rather than a single scan. Our nurse practitioners are the clinicians patients talk to after their scan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will review imaging and laboratory results with patients by phone and video, explain what the findings mean, and agree on the right next step together. You will work scheduled consult blocks alongside our full-time nurse practitioner team, to the same clinical and documentation standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a remote contract role, &lt;/strong&gt;and it &lt;strong&gt;reports to a Nurse Practitioner Manager. This is a 3-month contract position, &lt;/strong&gt;with the possibility of extension based on business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help reshape the world through proactive healthcare while working with cutting-edge technology and high performing teams with deep expertise - join us to make a difference in people’s lives!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct results review consultations by phone and video, reviewing imaging and laboratory results and explaining what they mean&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare for each consult by reviewing the patient&#39;s report, intake, history and prior scans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify care gaps and recommend next steps, including follow-up imaging, referrals and the interval to the next scan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow established protocols for actionable findings, and escalate urgent findings to Radiology and Preventive Medicine physicians through the defined escalation pathway&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with care coordinators and registered nurse navigators on follow-up and referral loop closure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document every encounter to clinical standard in HealthCloud, including a care plan the patient can access&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work the consult blocks you commit to, and give advance notice of schedule changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in quality reviews and complete required onboarding and protocol training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain active licensure and credentialing in assigned states&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Active, unrestricted Nurse Practitioner license (minimum of 10 licenses) &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;national board certification (FNP, AGNP or ANP)&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to obtain licensure in additional states as required; compact state nursing license required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Two or more years of clinical practice as a Nurse Practitioner,&lt;/strong&gt; preferably in primary care, internal medicine, preventive medicine or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to explain complex clinical findings clearly and without alarming patients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable delivering care by phone and video&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong documentation practice and comfort working in an electronic health record&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commitment to patient privacy and the handling of protected health information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with imaging interpretation in a clinical context preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in preventive or longevity medicine preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working remotely in a clinical role preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;First: we are &lt;strong&gt;Pioneers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transforming healthcare requires divergent thinking, bias for action, disciplined experimentation, and consistent grit and determination to maintain momentum. This journey is as challenging as it is rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Second: we are &lt;strong&gt;Platform-Builders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re always building foundations that allow us to achieve tomorrow more than we did today. We never lose sight of what’s ahead – in a mindset of ownership and duty to our mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all: we are &lt;strong&gt;Patients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We could all be the next person who walks through our very doors, seeking clarity or peace of mind. We are proud of our impact on our patients’ lives, and we won’t stop till everyone can benefit from our work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An avenue to make a positive impact on people&#39;s lives and their health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The hourly compensation range is $60 to $65&lt;/strong&gt; USD depending upon experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of the hiring process, successful candidates will undergo a background check in compliance to applicable federal, provincial, and state rules.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please be advised that official communication from our recruitment team will only come from our authorized domain [&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://prenuvo.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;prenuvo.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;]. If you are contacted by a recruiter, please ensure their email address ends with @prenuvo.com. We do not use third-party recruitment services or any other email domains for hiring purposes. If you receive communication that you believe to be fraudulent, please report it immediately to jobs@prenuvo.com.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
